# Run: python3 -I tools/build_set.py tools/sets/sci7_materials.py
# Numbers and math are written left-to-right inside Hebrew text: {…} is wrapped in Unicode isolates (LRI…PDI).
# Hebrew unit abbreviations use the real gershayim (״): סמ״ק, מ״ל, מ״ק, ק״ג, מ״ג, ס״מ.
